<title>USA: 17-state hog and pig inventory - USDA.</title>
<headline>17-state hog and pig inventory - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA hog/pig inventory in 17 major states. Current period as percent of prior year's period.</p>
<p>  1,000 head):  Pct   6/1/97   6/1/96</p>
